Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by setting the score of dotfiles to 0.0 during the initial search, which led to them being skipped in subsequent searches. This behavior prevented users from seeing dotfiles even when they explicitly searched for them by typing a period ('.'). The fix involved changing the score to -1.0 to hide dotfiles initially while allowing them to be matched when a period is typed.

